                <pb facs="0386" n="380" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg380"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-08-14"><hi rendition="#italic">August 14,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that this Government is prepared to send expert representatives
                    on tariff revision committee; that we have no information as to date of signing
                    protocol. Asks when it will be signed, and when should our expert go.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
